        "Id1": {
            "text": "The song Mermaid by Train is written in the reggae music genre and was followed by the band\u2019s cover of the John Lennon song Imagine. The original version of Imagine is in the pop music genre and was followed up by Lennon\u2019s hit Happy Xmas (War is Over)."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "Imagine, a pop song by John Lennon, was released prior to the reggae song Mermaid by Train. After the release of Imagine, the song Happy Xmas came out."
        },
